2. Definitions. - In these Rules unless the context otherwise requires, -
(a)
"Council" means the Council of States;
(b)
"House" means the House of the People;
(c)
"Houses" means the Council of States and the House of the People;
(d)
"Joint Sitting" means a joint sitting of the Houses;
(e)
"Member" means a member of the Council or of the House;
(f)
"Secretary-General" means the Secretary - General of the House and includes any person for the time being performing
the duties of the Secretary-General of the House;
(g)
"Speaker" means the Speaker of the House.
